+    \midrule
+    Branch score production & X/Ku, S-band, GBAD, acoustic, and passive-RF detector-view summaries & per-branch scores and failure slices & branch cards state what each branch cannot prove \\
+    Human-engineered fusion & calibrated branch scores, source confidence, stale-track flags, cross-sensor confirmation & accepted prior fusion probability and train/CV threshold & comparator is not a straw baseline \\
+    EI candidate discovery & train/CV detector-view scores and branch/fusion context only & sparse component list, nonnegative weights, monotone odds calibrator & no holdout rows used for selection \\
+    Locked holdout scoring & selection lock plus blind holdout detector views & KPI, confusion counts, calibration, false-alarm families & one score pass after lock \\
+    \bottomrule
